# The essential kit's audio, deliberately not published.
#
# These are real recordings from tidalcycles/Dirt-Samples, which ships NO
# licence file and states no terms — so redistributing them from a public repo
# is not something to do by accident. The files stay on the machines that have
# them and the app works normally; KIT.md below records what they are.
# See docs/AUDIO_ASSETS.md for how to put this right.
frontend/public/essential-kit/*.mp3

# A local backup of the previous CC0/MIT sample set. Nothing references it, and
# `node tools/fetch-samples.mjs` rebuilds it exactly, so it does not need to be
# carried in the repo.
frontend/public/samples-old/
